@startuml admin-events-moderation
!include admin-common.puml
title Modération d'événements - Liste

== Modération d'événements ==
Admin -> Frontend: Modérer événements signalés
Frontend -> API: GET /api/admin/events/flagged
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: getFlaggedEvents()
AdminCtrl -> EventSvc: getEventsByStatus(flagged)
EventSvc -> DB: SELECT events WITH reports WHERE status=flagged OR report_count > 0
DB --> EventSvc: flagged events
EventSvc --> AdminCtrl: events with reports
AdminCtrl --> API: flagged events
API --> Frontend: events list
Frontend --> Admin: Événements à modérer

@enduml